  "description": "Khentkawes I was a queen of the 4th dynasty of ancient Egypt. She may have been a daughter of the pharaoh Menkaure, and the wife of both kings Shepseskaf and Userkaf. Her tomb at Giza \u2013 LG100 \u2013 is located close to Menkaure's pyramid complex.",
